--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a1e73c5106fe4f24f8c623b663cb8311, type: 3}
  m_Name: Demo Ending
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerSprites:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 433f75f2fdaa60948b8f45ad0a1859d2, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: d37d63abaf6c441429e37a5eb4319bf6, type: 3}
  sceneStills:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f95a98fe17bf9034082aad2bf7cebfd3, type: 3}
  directions:
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I litter the ocean with wrecking balls, you don\u2019t stop surfing. "
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I send genetically engineered attack sharks into the sea, you don\u2019t
      stop surfing. "
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I spend hours of my own time getting seagulls familiar with your scent,
      training them to dive into waves and pluck your eyes out, yet you still won\u2019t
      stop!"
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: I gotta admit, I admire your tenacity.
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "And I admire your melting skin. Get the hell off my beach bro, the
      shopping mall\u2019s not getting made."
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha.
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "What\u2019s funny?"
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Here I was thinking you were brighter than the rest, but you still
      think I\u2019m here to build a shopping mall."
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: What?! Explain-
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I\u2019ll be seeing you again soon. Ha ha ha ha ha\u2026"
  - leftSpeaker: Player
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Dammit! I need to know more about his plan but\u2026 this is the end
      of the demo. I guess I\u2019ll just have to keep surfing in the meantime."
